  - name: Broadridge Net Down
    detail: Broadridge is unreachable
    fluxfile: flux/bfs_net_down.flux
    severity: 1
    threshold: 1
    calendar: OfficeHours 
    comparison: gt
    tags: 
      - host
      - _field
      - _measurement
      - server
      - port 
      - service
    interval: 300
    target: xapi
    action: | 
              Although BFS occassionally flaps, any extended outage may prevent file transfers and MQ messaging.
              Login to manually verify that network is recovered. If not open and incident for Azure Network Support
